sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-heteroneura-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-heteroneura-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-heteroneura-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Drosophila heteroneura detail-scale Turing wavelength (5.222 µm, Holocene 0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 83.3/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 dispersion root is 5.222 µm with h(k_c)=-1802.8 and equal-diffusion growth rate -5.106. Specimen ring spacing is 68.47 µm (111 px = 100 µm). Radial-envelope Pearson r = 0.98482, RMSE = 0.01911, CV similarity of the pre-carrier GIF = 87.7. Guttifera mode count in that metrics file is 205 because it used rounding, not the Lean truncating division. Overall 83.3/100 (faithfulness 82.7, reproducibility 84.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 1fc59ceabb8ad3bc2b65011b9e189d8de99889cf; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 80, Morphological realism / specimen match 84, Parameter expressivity 86, Morphometric validation 82, Source and data traceability 88, Code-to-model traceability 82, Reproducibility package 84. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_heteroneura_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-heteroneura-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 1fc59ceabb8ad3bc2b65011b9e189d8de99889cf, image/png, 716053 B, 1632×984 px, artifact_sha256 3018a50272e00371b323ac8cc5b2c574249094ace8bb978d7da9380ac0e2429a (sha256 3018a50272e00371b323ac8cc5b2c574249094ace8bb978d7da9380ac0e2429a), spec_fingerprint 8a1f331b3be2f0cf1fa4050625a9c91a1498e46f0561e6a84f91a7b74b46e9aa. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 4b21b7c69b3d1f5fc1cb70f9be69842c1f8a42ab65644a6367b446725ab39515; artifact_sha256: 3018a50272e00371b323ac8cc5b2c574249094ace8bb978d7da9380ac0e2429a; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_heteroneura_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_heteroneura_specimen.jpg=23a06203ecdd717e..., datasets/drosophila_heteroneura_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_heteroneura_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=c8bbca96708967c8..., datasets/drosophila_heteroneura_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=6d9ece5ab667efce...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation and Schnakenberg 1979 kinetics | Spieth 1981 documents the heteroneura hammerhead head relative to silvestris | Werner 2010: guttifera wing spots are Wingless-induced yellow melanin | Pitnick 1995: hydei is a giant-sperm repleta-group fly; reconstructed_in_script: a=0.064, b=1.137, Dv/Du=36.5, gamma=18.6 chosen so lambda_c is 5.222 µm | Neighbor gammas set by lambda proportional to gamma^{-1/2} | Head width 1.72 mm is reconstructed, not a caliper measurement | Radial envelope is a 4-harmonic least-squares fit to the gallery micrograph; transfer_boundary: Guttifera and hydei are Delphi chronoseries neighbors at 0 Ma, not stratigraphic ancestors; does_not_claim: That the micrograph's 68.47 µm rings are the 5.222 µm critical mode | That the kinetic constants were measured in a heteroneura pigment assay | A second independent assessor." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [independent_assessor/source-traceability, pressure P=1.1]: A second assessor from another provider has not scored this loop.",
            "open need [morphometric_validation/morphometric-validation, pressure P=1.2]: Align mode counts with Loop_3188 integer division.",
            "open need [specimen_comparison/model-fidelity, pressure P=1.5]: Render the 5.222 µm carrier on the envelope and record its pixel period.",
            "remediation needed: R1: Modulate the rendered envelope by the 5.222 µm carrier and record its pixel period. Pass-1 metrics omit carrier_period_px.",
            "remediation needed: R2: Count head-capsule modes with the Lean truncating division 1720000//lambda_nm. Pass-1 guttifera count is 205, not 204.",
            "remediation needed: R3: Independent second assessor. This pass is builder-scored.",
            "remediation needed: R4: Head width 1.72 mm is reconstructed from Spieth 1981, not measured on this micrograph." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.833"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, single agent)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

